# MC-X-F12 (writer 9): a move with no at reads a band whose rows govern always (L §4.3: not law-dated; "A
# movement's law date is its at, required whenever the move reads anything law-dated"). pay books rate(3) =
# 400.00 PLN on 2027-02-01 into konto, from 0 PLN at the opening.
=== m.tally
model p
  tally 2
  on 2027-12-31
  start 2027-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
source act "the act"
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2020-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input age3: int
input pay_day: date
band rate(a: int): money PLN

move pay: transfers
  on pay_day
  leg cash from world to konto amount rate(age3)

ask q: bal(konto, 2027-12-31)

version v_act
  cite act
  governs always
  known 2026-12-01
  rate: [0, 6) = 400.00 PLN "under 6"
  rate: [6, 18) = 250.00 PLN "6 to 17"

version v_f
  cite act
  governs always
  known 2026-12-01
  age3 = 3 "the age"
  pay_day = 2027-02-01
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2027-01-01 start
=== expect
q: 400.00 PLN
...
